        <h1>AI Automation Services for DTC Brands: What to Look For</h1>
        <div class="post-meta">
          <span>By <a href="/about/"><strong>Kevin Freeland</strong></a></span>
          <span>March 14, 2026</span>
          <span>9 min read</span>
